span><span begin="01:56.880" end="01:57.030">it's </span><span begin="01:57.030" end="01:58.170">fair </span><span begin="01:58.170" end="01:58.650">if </span><span begin="01:58.650" end="01:58.920">he </span><span begin="01:58.920" end="01:59.310">always </span><span begin="01:59.310" end="01:59.610">pays </span><span begin="01:59.610" end="01:59.730">the </span><span begin="01:59.730" end="02:00.150">rent</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.240" end="02:02.430"><span begin="02:00.240" end="02:00.540">And </span><span begin="02:00.540" end="02:00.630">he </span><span begin="02:00.630" end="02:01.140">doesn't </span><span begin="02:01.140" end="02:01.590">get </span><span begin="02:01.590" end="02:01.920">bent </span><span begin="02:01.920" end="02:02.430">about</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.430" end="02:05.400"><span begin="02:02.430" end="02:03.060">Sleeping </span><span begin="02:03.060" end="02:03.240">on </span><span begin="02:03.240" end="02:03.360">the </span><span begin="02:03.360" end="02:03.720">couch </span><span begin="02:03.720" end="02:03.990">when </span><span begin="02:03.990" end="02:04.290">I'm </span><span begin="02:04.290" end="02:05.400">there</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.400" end="02:07.020"><span begin="02:05.400" end="02:05.790">'Cos </span><span begin="02:05.790" end="02:05.880">I </span><span begin="02:05.880" end="02:06.480">like </span><span begin="02:06.480" end="02:07.020">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.230" end="02:08.940"><span begin="02:07.230" end="02:07.590">Yeah </span><span begin="02:07.590" end="02:07.710">I </span><span begin="02:07.710" end="02:08.310">like </span><span begin="02:08.310" end="02:08.940">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.120" end="02:12.570"><span begin="02:09.120" end="02:09.450">And </span><span begin="02:09.450" end="02:09.540">I'm </span><span begin="02:09.540" end="02:10.260">feeling </span><span begin="02:10.260" end="02:10.530">so </span><span begin="0